# React app (app/) — generated at build time, never committed:
#   app/src/assets/*  mirrored from the repository's canonical assets/
#   app/public/*      icons + the JSON corpus derived from data/kurals.js
#                     + the trained Ask Valluvar model (data/intents.json)
# Both are produced by `npm run sync`, and CI verifies parity with --check
# (the model is regenerated and compared by `train-intent.mjs --check`).
app/src/assets/
app/public/icons/
app/public/data/
*.tsbuildinfo
